   "source": [
    "# Trabalho Computacional — Equações Diferenciais I\n",
    "**Alunos:** Eudes, Eduardo e Steffany\n",
    "\n",
    "## Decaimento radioativo da cadeia de massa 135\n",
    "\n",
    "Compara os métodos de **Euler** e **Runge–Kutta de quarta ordem (RK4)** com a solução analítica."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cell-02",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Modelo matemático\n",
    "\n",
    "O sistema de cinco equações diferenciais é\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\begin{aligned}\n",
    "\\frac{dN_1}{dt} &=-\\lambda_1N_1,\\\\\n",
    "\\frac{dN_2}{dt} &= \\lambda_1N_1-\\lambda_2N_2,\\\\\n",
    "\\frac{dN_3}{dt} &= \\lambda_2N_2-\\lambda_3N_3,\\\\\n",
    "\\frac{dN_4}{dt} &= \\lambda_3N_3-\\lambda_4N_4,\\\\\n",
    "\\frac{dN_5}{dt} &= \\lambda_4N_4.\n",
    "\\end{aligned}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "As condições iniciais em $t=0$ são\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "(N_1,N_2,N_3,N_4,N_5)=(1{,}0\\times10^{24},\\,0,\\,0,\\,0,\\,0).\n",
    "$$\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 327,
   "id": "cell-03",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "%matplotlib inline\n",
    "%config InlineBackend.figure_format = 'svg'\n",
    "pd.set_option(\"display.max_columns\", None)\n",
    "pd.set_option(\"display.width\", 160)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cell-04",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Parâmetros do problema\n",
    "\n",
    "As constantes de decaimento são calculadas por $\\lambda=\\ln(2)/T_{1/2}$, com todos os tempos em segundos."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 328,
   "id": "cell-05",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Constantes de decaimento:\n",
      "  Sb-135: lambda = 6.795561e-03 s^-1 (T1/2 = 102 s)\n",
      "  Te-135: lambda = 3.648143e-02 s^-1 (T1/2 = 19 s)\n",
      "  I-135 : lambda = 2.930607e-05 s^-1 (T1/2 = 23652 s)\n",
      "  Xe-135: lambda = 2.106574e-05 s^-1 (T1/2 = 32904 s)\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "TEMPOS_MEIA_VIDA_S = np.array([102.0, 19.0, 23_652.0, 32_904.0])\n",
    "LAMBDA = np.log(2.0) / TEMPOS_MEIA_VIDA_S\n",
    "\n",
    "N1_INICIAL = 1.0e24\n",
    "Y_INICIAL = np.array([N1_INICIAL, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0])\n",
    "T_INICIAL = 0.0\n",
    "T_FINAL = 600.0\n",
    "\n",
    "TEMPOS_ERRO = np.array([0.0, 150.0, 300.0, 450.0, 600.0])\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Constantes de decaimento:\")\n",
    "for nome, meia_vida, taxa in zip(\n",
    "    [\"Sb-135\", \"Te-135\", \"I-135\", \"Xe-135\"],\n",
    "    TEMPOS_MEIA_VIDA_S,\n",
    "    LAMBDA,\n",
    "):\n",
    "    print(f\"  {nome:6s}: lambda = {taxa:.6e} s^-1 (T1/2 = {meia_vida:g} s)\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cell-06",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Implementação do sistema de equações diferenciais"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 329,
   "id": "cell-07",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def sistema_radioativo(t, N, lambdas):\n",
    "    lambda1, lambda2, lambda3, lambda4 = lambdas\n",
    "    N1, N2, N3, N4, N5 = N\n",
    "    return np.array(\n",
    "        [-lambda1 * N1,\n",
    "         lambda1 * N1 - lambda2 * N2,\n",
    "         lambda2 * N2 - lambda3 * N3,\n",
    "         lambda3 * N3 - lambda4 * N4,\n",
    "         lambda4 * N4],\n",
    "        dtype=float,\n",
    "    )"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cell-08",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Métodos numéricos"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 330,
   "id": "cell-09",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def euler_sistema(h, t_inicial, N_inicial, lambdas, n_passos):\n",
    "    tempos = np.empty(n_passos + 1, dtype=float)\n",
    "    solucoes = np.empty((n_passos + 1, len(N_inicial)), dtype=float)\n",
    "    tempos[0] = t_inicial\n",
    "    solucoes[0] = N_inicial\n",
    "    for k in range(n_passos):\n",
    "        t = tempos[k]\n",
    "        N = solucoes[k]\n",
    "        solucoes[k + 1] = N + h * sistema_radioativo(t, N, lambdas)\n",
    "        tempos[k + 1] = t + h\n",
    "    return tempos, solucoes"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 331,
   "id": "cell-10",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def rk4_sistema(h, t_inicial, N_inicial, lambdas, n_passos):\n",
    "    tempos = np.empty(n_passos + 1, dtype=float)\n",
    "    solucoes = np.empty((n_passos + 1, len(N_inicial)), dtype=float)\n",
    "    tempos[0] = t_inicial\n",
    "    solucoes[0] = N_inicial\n",
    "    for k in range(n_passos):\n",
    "        t = tempos[k]\n",
    "        N = solucoes[k]\n",
    "        k1 = sistema_radioativo(t, N, lambdas)\n",
    "        k2 = sistema_radioativo(t + 0.5 * h, N + 0.5 * h * k1, lambdas)\n",
    "        k3 = sistema_radioativo(t + 0.5 * h, N + 0.5 * h * k2, lambdas)\n",
    "        k4 = sistema_radioativo(t + h, N + h * k3, lambdas)\n",
    "        solucoes[k + 1] = N + (h / 6.0) * (k1 + 2.0 * k2 + 2.0 * k3 + k4)\n",
    "        tempos[k + 1] = t + h\n",
    "    return tempos, solucoes"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cell-11",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Solução analítica (fórmula de Bateman)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 332,
   "id": "cell-12",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def solucao_analitica(tempos):\n",
    "    tempos = np.asarray(tempos, dtype=float)\n",
    "    solucao = np.zeros((len(tempos), 5), dtype=float)\n",
    "    for quantidade in range(1, 5):\n",
    "        produto_das_taxas = np.prod(LAMBDA[: quantidade - 1])\n",
    "        for indice_taxa in range(quantidade):\n",
    "            outras_taxas = np.delete(LAMBDA[:quantidade], indice_taxa)\n",
    "            denominador = np.prod(outras_taxas - LAMBDA[indice_taxa])\n",
    "            solucao[:, quantidade - 1] += (\n",
    "                N1_INICIAL * produto_das_taxas\n",
    "                * np.exp(-LAMBDA[indice_taxa] * tempos)\n",
    "                / denominador\n",
    "            )\n",
    "    solucao[:, 4] = N1_INICIAL - np.sum(solucao[:, :4], axis=1)\n",
    "    mascara_t0 = np.isclose(tempos, T_INICIAL, rtol=0.0, atol=1e-12)\n",
    "    solucao[mascara_t0, :] = Y_INICIAL\n",
    "    return solucao\n",
    "\n",
    "TEMPO_ANALITICO = np.linspace(T_INICIAL, T_FINAL, 1201)\n",
    "SOLUCAO_ANALITICA = solucao_analitica(TEMPO_ANALITICO)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cell-13",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. Execução das simulações"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 333,
   "id": "cell-14",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Euler | h =  1.0 s | n = 600 | t_final = 600.0 s\n",
      "Euler | h =  5.0 s | n = 120 | t_final = 600.0 s\n",
      "Euler | h = 10.0 s | n =  60 | t_final = 600.0 s\n",
      "RK4   | h =  2.0 s | n = 300 | t_final = 600.0 s\n",
      "RK4   | h =  5.0 s | n = 120 | t_final = 600.0 s\n",
      "RK4   | h = 10.0 s | n =  60 | t_final = 600.0 s\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "CONFIGURACOES = [\n",
    "    (\"Euler\", 1.0, euler_sistema),\n",
    "    (\"Euler\", 5.0, euler_sistema),\n",
    "    (\"Euler\", 10.0, euler_sistema),\n",
    "    (\"RK4\", 2.0, rk4_sistema),\n",
    "    (\"RK4\", 5.0, rk4_sistema),\n",
    "    (\"RK4\", 10.0, rk4_sistema),\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "RESULTADOS = {}\n",
    "\n",
    "for metodo, h, solver in CONFIGURACOES:\n",
    "    n_passos = int(round((T_FINAL - T_INICIAL) / h))\n",
    "    if not np.isclose(T_INICIAL + n_passos * h, T_FINAL):\n",
    "        raise ValueError(f\"O passo h={h} s não divide o intervalo de 0 a 600 s.\")\n",
    "    tempos, solucoes = solver(h=h, t_inicial=T_INICIAL, N_inicial=Y_INICIAL, lambdas=LAMBDA, n_passos=n_passos)\n",
    "    RESULTADOS[(metodo, h)] = {\"tempo\": tempos, \"N\": solucoes}\n",
    "    print(f\"{metodo:5s} | h = {h:4.1f} s | n = {n_passos:3d} | t_final = {tempos[-1]:.1f} s\")"
   ]
  },
